{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他想知道对方是否觉得他特别，可对方没答应过什么，他怕一问就把相处弄尴尬，又舍不得眼前的好就这样过去。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得眼前的好\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思放回自己能给的关心上，告诉自己，看到对方高兴，自己也会高兴，不必等对方有所表示。\",\n      \"key\": \"看到对方高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"这样想确实让他松了口气，也更愿意对对方好，不再计较给了多少，也不再怕显得更在乎。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再怕显得更在乎\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"这次轻松让他以为，只要不向对方要回应，就能放心地尽情喜欢，也不会失去什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去什么\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想知道自己是否特别、却不愿催促对方的矛盾，并补出舍不得眼前的好过去的心情，解释热烈中仍有不安、想抓紧却怕破坏亲近，以及甜蜜里的酸楚。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把普遍的关系原则改成他当下用来安抚自己的具体想法，保留把心思放回关心、看到对方高兴自己也会高兴、不必等待对方表示的尝试，解释反复强调的迫切感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留这个办法确实让他松快、使他更愿意付出、不再计较给了多少和不怕显得更在乎。两条都在写投入变得更自在，合并后删去重复且抽象的心里更丰盈这一结论。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时有效的自我调整过度推成不会失去什么的保证，明确这是他当时的确信，而不是故事认可的道理。这样既留下真实的轻松，也保住 S05 再次想被看见、继而难堪的直接前提。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8003ce44-aa75-4d17-8a54-c8b9ffb406ae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053230785559Z", "elapsed_seconds": 548.719, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:41:39.512478+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e735c530c543a67dcee8e660ee0b66cb0d8b3a2c2ced1f64f6154c9483b6b2db", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053230785559Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a7d09712e63d5d2cfc58f90dc33ea7595409eaec8dadadd8af64f1c9e757ee69"}}}
